[
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "defaultValue": "Biomon"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "defaultValue": "Biomon is a toy, not a medical device. Stress, energy, water and food are estimates dressed up as a game HUD. Don't use them to make decisions about your health."
  },
  {
    "type": "section",
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Look"
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "Theme",
        "label": "HUD style",
        "defaultValue": "0",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Subnautica",
            "value": "0"
          },
          {
            "label": "Rust",
            "value": "1"
          },
          {
            "label": "Cyberpunk 2077",
            "value": "2"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "section",
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "About you"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Used to estimate how much water and energy you need in a day, which sets how much of a meter one cup or one meal is worth: water from weight (between 1.5 and 3.5 litres), energy from the Mifflin-St Jeor equation plus the activity your watch has counted. The log panel shows these estimates once you've saved this page."
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "Sex",
        "label": "Sex",
        "defaultValue": "2",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Male",
            "value": "0"
          },
          {
            "label": "Female",
            "value": "1"
          },
          {
            "label": "Other / rather not say",
            "value": "2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "input",
        "messageKey": "Age",
        "label": "Age",
        "defaultValue": "35",
        "attributes": {
          "type": "number",
          "min": 10,
          "max": 110
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "input",
        "messageKey": "WeightKg",
        "label": "Weight (kg)",
        "defaultValue": "75",
        "attributes": {
          "type": "number",
          "min": 25,
          "max": 300
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "input",
        "messageKey": "HeightCm",
        "label": "Height (cm)",
        "defaultValue": "172",
        "attributes": {
          "type": "number",
          "min": 100,
          "max": 250
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "section",
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Water and food"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Each meter drains while you're awake: quickly down to 50%, where the watch buzzes and opens Biomon, then much more slowly. To log a drink or a meal, tap its meter, or press Up for water and Down for food. Up and Down then change the amount, Select logs it and Back cancels. How far a cup or a meal refills the bar comes from the details under About you. The meters only know what you log, and reminders stop for the day once you've logged your estimated requirement."
      },
      {
        "type": "toggle",
        "messageKey": "TrackWater",
        "label": "Track water",
        "defaultValue": true
      },
      {
        "type": "toggle",
        "messageKey": "TrackFood",
        "label": "Track food",
        "defaultValue": true
      },
      {
        "type": "slider",
        "messageKey": "NagInterval",
        "label": "Repeat a reminder every (minutes)",
        "description": "While a meter stays under 50%. 0 reminds once and then stays quiet.",
        "defaultValue": 20,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 60,
        "step": 5
      },
      {
        "type": "toggle",
        "messageKey": "Vibrate",
        "label": "Vibrate on reminders",
        "defaultValue": true
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "VolumeUnit",
        "label": "Show water in",
        "defaultValue": "0",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Millilitres",
            "value": "0"
          },
          {
            "label": "Fluid ounces",
            "value": "1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "EnergyUnit",
        "label": "Show food in",
        "defaultValue": "0",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "Kilojoules",
            "value": "0"
          },
          {
            "label": "Calories",
            "value": "1"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "section",
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Quiet hours"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "No reminders between these hours, and the meters stop draining. The day's totals in the log panel reset when quiet hours end. Set both to the same hour to turn quiet hours off."
      },
      {
        "type": "slider",
        "messageKey": "QuietStart",
        "label": "From (hour, 24h)",
        "defaultValue": 22,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 23,
        "step": 1
      },
      {
        "type": "slider",
        "messageKey": "QuietEnd",
        "label": "Until (hour, 24h)",
        "defaultValue": 7,
        "min": 0,
        "max": 23,
        "step": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "section",
    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "defaultValue": "Stress and energy"
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "defaultValue": "Stress is estimated from heart rate variability, compared against a baseline the watch learns for you. It needs at least 20 resting readings over two days before it shows a score. Low variability isn't always stress: coffee, alcohol, a meal or a cold do it too. The health bar is your energy: it recharges while you sleep and drains with activity and stress, and a run of short nights stops it recharging all the way. Wear the watch to bed, and after three nights it starts judging each night against your usual."
      },
      {
        "type": "select",
        "messageKey": "HrvInterval",
        "label": "Measure HRV every",
        "description": "More often reacts faster but costs battery.",
        "defaultValue": "15",
        "options": [
          {
            "label": "5 minutes",
            "value": "5"
          },
          {
            "label": "10 minutes",
            "value": "10"
          },
          {
            "label": "15 minutes",
            "value": "15"
          },
          {
            "label": "30 minutes",
            "value": "30"
          },
          {
            "label": "60 minutes",
            "value": "60"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "toggle",
        "messageKey": "ResetBaseline",
        "label": "Reset learned baselines on save",
        "defaultValue": false
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "submit",
    "defaultValue": "Save"
  }
]
